{"id":1050502,"chapter_id":1050502,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你啊，地上的天堂! 究竟是什么符咒\n\n曾能用不祥的阴影把你蒙蔽?","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"从压迫的巢穴粪土中诞生的一千个年头\n\n用血和泪玷污了你晶莹的明辉\n\n直到你的美妙的群星得以把污点哭去。","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"建筑工人","content":"喂，楼顶那个什么诗人，赶紧下来，我们要施工了！","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502004,"trial_step":4},{"step":4,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"来了来了，这不是想着你们要开工了，先给你们吟诗一首打打气。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502005,"trial_step":5},{"step":5,"speaker":"建筑工人","content":"随便你怎么说吧，你只要不每天都出现在我们的施工地点就行了。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"那怎么行，这在黑夜之下劳作的身影是多么令人敬佩，那燃烧着的灵魂又是多么的璀璨！","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"speaker":"建筑工人","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"content":"诸如此类的情景每天都在上演，也不知道是渡鸦的记者本能所致，还是她真的很关心学校建设的进度。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"content":"隔三差五就能见到渡鸦去和管理局派去的施工队进行“亲切交流”的场面。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"content":"所幸管理局的施工队员们也算是见过大场面的人，就算是面对禁闭者，也没有什么较大的情绪波动。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"content":"当然，就算时不时和施工队员们插科打诨，但渡鸦本人却也没闲下来。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"大晚上的你也过来，是管理局工作不饱和了？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"你刚想说点什么，渡鸦便把一个厚厚的文件袋塞到了你的怀里。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"content":"你拆开文件袋，取出里面的纸张，只瞄了几眼，那熟悉到不能再熟悉的浮夸风格便再度侵入你的脑海。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"辛迪加大学堂，所有辛迪加孩子们梦与希望的终点！","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"content":"远离纷争，拥抱和平！驱逐阴影，践行真理！","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"content":"MBCC局长倾力赞助，你还在等什么，赶快入学吧？","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"options":["……"],"style":6,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502019,"trial_step":19,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……","goto":20}]},{"step":19,"speaker":"玩家","content":"你写的这是什么？","style":2,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"看了不就知道，招生简章啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"辛迪加嘛，就是要有辛迪加自己的风格才对！","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"speaker":"玩家","content":"你怎么突然想写这东西了？","style":2,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"昨天我在视察学校的时候，我发现有间教室已经算是建好了，然后我就赶紧把桌椅板凳都搬进去看了看。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"你还别说，教室还挺大的，放五十把桌椅也绰绰有余，都快赶上我在新城上学时的教室了。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"然后我就在想啊，既然有了桌椅，我不如把讲台和黑板都一块弄过来吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"你看，现在这里什么都有了，是不是就只缺学生了？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"content":"渡鸦指了指教室里空荡荡的桌椅，又挥了挥自己手里厚厚一沓的“招生简章”。","style":3,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"你就看我的吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1068,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"隔日。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"content":"辛迪加大学堂的门前，不时地会探出几个充满好奇的小脑袋。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"content":"他们通常只是先远远地看着，而渡鸦也先是装作没看到他们。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"content":"就像是木头人的游戏一般，孩子们会趁着渡鸦看教材的期间，偷偷摸摸地靠近教室，或是偷偷瞟上几眼教学楼。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"content":"然后这个时候，渡鸦则会鬼使神差地突然回头，于此同时，那几个好奇脑袋则会不约而同地缩到窗下。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"options":["没关系么？"],"style":6,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没关系么？","goto":36}]},{"step":35,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"没关系的，孩子们总会耐不住性子的。我们只需要在这里等着就好，比起这个，该给我看看教材了。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"content":"你打开车的后备箱，取出了几本教材，递给渡鸦。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"content":"渡鸦接过你的教材之后，哗啦哗啦地快速翻阅着。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"虽然不想承认，这些教材写得还算可以，基本都是稍微改改就能用的程度。但这一本……我想再改改。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"content":"渡鸦将历史课本从一摞书中抽出，放到了桌上。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"speaker":"伊卡","content":"瑞文老师。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"突如其来的声音打断了渡鸦，几个孩子好像是下定决心一样，从窗户底下走了出来。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"哎呀，怎么突然这么亲切，直接叫老师我的本名，还真有点让人不适应呢。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"伊卡","content":"我们其实……","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"其实很想上学？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊卡","content":"不，我们是想和你学写诗。因为当时你的诗给了我们很多鼓舞。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"content":"你很少见地观察到了渡鸦有些无语的神情，但很快便恢复了原样。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"哈哈……当然可以了，只要你们来上课，每节课上都能学到狄斯诗人最激昂的诗歌。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"speaker":"伊卡","content":"那，我能只来听诗歌的课么……因为有人说，您其他课……有点……","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"谁说的。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"content":"渡鸦挑了挑眉，孩子们则相视一笑。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"不说是吧，让我猜猜……能说出这种话的，估计也只有……","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"speaker":"科希","content":"是我说的。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"content":"一道阴影缓缓自墙根延伸而出，缓缓化为实体。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"哈哈，这不是逃课又辍学的淘气包吗。怎么，翅膀硬了，已经敢说老师的不是了？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"speaker":"科希","content":"你留下的那几本教材我翻来覆去看过好多次，有些东西对于他们现在来说太难了，不适合。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"呦，这么爱看我写的东西？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"content":"渡鸦揶揄地笑了。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"speaker":"科希","content":"……臭乌鸦。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"我承认，教流浪儿的那一阵，我初中都毕业快有十几年了，有些东西把握不好难度也是难免的。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"不过，现在不一样了——","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"content":"渡鸦指向了一旁从管理局车辆上搬运着教材的你。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"有了MBCC危机管理局局长的帮助，这次的教材必定会万无一失！","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"狄斯语，数学，历史，社会，科学，所有一切能教的，我都会倾囊相授。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"我会让你们彻底改变自己，成为辛迪加的新兴一代，承载所有希望走向未来。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"content":"看着眼前诚挚的渡鸦，流浪儿的首领明显有些招架不住。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"speaker":"科希","content":"姑且……信你一次吧。不过，这些应该是新城的书吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"content":"科希扫视了一周，目光停留在桌上光鲜亮丽的历史课本上足足好几秒才挪开。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"speaker":"科希","content":"<size=25> 新城的书，会记得辛迪加的血与泪么……</size>","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"content":"——","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"content":"一阵铃声从学校传出，你看了看表，正好是下午两点。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"speaker":"建筑工人","content":"抱歉，没吵到你们吧？我们正在给教室装上下课铃，没想到突然就响了。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"content":"你摆了摆手示意没关系，而科希则离开你们的身侧，向着学校的另一端走去。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"speaker":"科希","content":"时间快到了，伊卡。该上流浪儿的格斗技巧课了。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"speaker":"伊卡","content":"啊……好的首领。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"speaker":"科希","content":"还有，你的课……我会期待一下的，就一下。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"科希没有回头，只是对着你们的方向挥了挥手。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"一路走好，开课的时候记得来哦~老师我等着你们~","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"content":"渡鸦一边向流浪儿们的背影挥手，直到他们的身影完全消失在另一端。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"真是直觉灵敏的小鬼啊……等我上课可得给她多布置点作业。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"content":"渡鸦叹了一口气，默默地翻开了眼前的教材。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"N.F.84年，内海发生大爆炸，BR-000爆发，其带来的深远影响至今难以消除。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"辛迪加原称“西区”，根据《西区管理条例》，该城区交由暴力团伙自治。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"依赖于奇兰博士发现的异方晶，狄斯城才得以建立。以此为基础，狄斯城发展为大陆上唯一的超级大都会，吸引无数移民，迎来了令人目眩的辉煌繁盛。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"我随便在教材里找了两段，你觉得怎么样？","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"options":["给孩子看的话还行","好像哪里不太对"],"style":6,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502087,"trial_step":87,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"给孩子看的话还行","goto":88},{"text":"好像哪里不太对","goto":null}]},{"step":87,"speaker":"玩家","content":"似乎没怎么提到辛迪加？","style":2,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"他们还将辛迪加模糊化，但凡提到辛迪加的，都会统称为狄斯城。更严重的时候，还会将辛迪加污名化。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"这绝不是辛迪加孩子们该接受的历史。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"当黑暗被掩埋时，光辉也被掩埋。我决不允许一代又一代辛迪加人们的努力付之东流。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"他们的牺牲，他们的光荣成就，需要被他人铭记。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502092,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"我其实一直很坚定的，我想让孩子们看到更美好的世界，想让他们一直坚信前方有光。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"至少直到那件事发生之前……我都是这样坚信的。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"content":"很少见地，向来坚定又一往无前的渡鸦陷入了迷茫。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"speaker":"渡鸦","content":"跟我一起来吧，米诺斯的局长，我需要你的帮助和意见。","voice":["vo_trial_50502_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"content":"渡鸦向你伸出了手。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150502097,"trial_step":97}]}